# Sazacap's Brew with the gift promised, but Bot1's Ornithopter is killed in response: one target (the player) is still legal, so the spell resolves, doing as much as it
# can (CR 608.2b) - Bot1 draws two, the creature is not pumped - and the gift is given (CR 702.174j): Bot2 creates a tapped Fish.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Sazacap's Brew
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
